Third-party software
--------------------
This plugin currently bundles no third-party libraries. It links against The
Foundry's NDK (DDImage), provided by the user's own Nuke installation and not
redistributed here. The stroke-placement approach follows A. Hertzmann,
"Painterly Rendering with Curved Brush Strokes of Multiple Sizes", SIGGRAPH
1998 (algorithm reimplemented from the paper; no code was reused).

If a future version bundles third-party binaries or source, reproduce each
dependency's license text in this section and ship this file alongside the
DLL (see the repository's dev rules, NDK_NOTES 8.3).
